prompt.template:
Help me prepare for a performance review. Below is a summary of my work results for {range}, taken from my impact log.

Write a self-assessment:
- open with the 3–5 most significant results and their impact on the team, product or business;
- group the rest by theme, briefly and concretely;
- use only the facts, numbers and links from the text below.

Do not invent results, numbers, projects or ratings. If there isn’t enough data for a strong statement, list at the end the questions I should clarify.
